\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Hypergraph visualization of three intertwining contexts for the word `bank'. The central vector $\bm  {v}(\text  {bank})$ is a shared element common to three distinct contexts (orthonormal bases). Each context connects $\bm  {v}(\text  {run})$ to a different semantic association: physical activity ($\bm  {v}(\text  {exercise})$), management ($\bm  {v}(\text  {business})$), and flow ($\bm  {v}(\text  {river})$).}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
